lens_profiles.invalid = Paw Lensfun v1/v2 XML data akorae a ɛyɛ papa (ɛnnuru 8 MiB) a ɛwɔ kamera anaa lens ho nsɛm a wɔboa.
lens_profiles.calibration = Lens no nhyehyɛe a wɔasusuw
lens_profiles.no_calibration = Nhyehyɛe a wɔasusuw biara nhyia saa nhyehyɛe yi. Hwɛ focal tentene ne kamera no crop factor; wubetumi asiesie no wɔ wo nsa mu.
lens_profiles.import = Fa Lensfun XML bra mu…
lens_profiles.imported = Wɔde Lensfun data akorae no aba saa bere yi mu. Paw lens profile anaa fa mfonini no ho nsɛm hwehwɛ nea ɛfata.
lens_profiles.manual = Wo nsa mu nsiesie nkutoo
lens_profiles.saved = Nhyehyɛe a wɔakora so (data akorae no nni hɔ)
lens_profiles.profile = Lens ho profile
lens_profiles.aperture = Aperture (0 = wonnim)
lens_profiles.distance = Baabi a wɔde adwene si (0 = wonnim)
lens_profiles.vignette = Vignette a wɔasusuw no
lens_profiles.color_context = Vignette a wɔasusuw no hia sRGB profile a ɛwɔ mu no. Dane mfonini no kɔ sRGB mu na ne kɔla akɔ so ate sɛnea ɛte, na san bue Siesie Lens. Sɛ piksel no yɛ sRGB dedaw nanso wɔnni profile ahyɛnsode a, fa sRGB profile ma wɔn ara kwa. Geometry ne chromatic nsiesie da so wɔ hɔ.
lens_profiles.vignette_missing = Vignette nhyehyɛe biara nhyia aperture ne baabi a wɔde adwene si no. Kyerɛw dodow a woasusuw no na ɛayɛ adwuma; wɔ Lensfun profile pii mu no, 1000 m kyerɛ sɛ wɔde adwene asi akyirikyiri.
lens_profiles.note = Nsiesie a wɔasusuw no di kan ansa na nea wɔde nsa yɛ no. Fa mfonini mũ no a edi kan no di dwuma; twa n'ano akyiri yi. Kora filter ahorow no wɔ PSD/PSB mu na woatumi asesa nhyehyɛe a wɔasusuw no.
lens_profiles.automatic = Fa mfonini no ho nsɛm hwehwɛ nea ɛfata
lens_profiles.components = Profile nsiesie: sɛso a akyea {distortion}; kɔla a ɛwɔ ano {tca}; vignette {vignette}.
